  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well, this is a pretty unusual circum- stance..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...but if you're talking about potential damage, yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You're lucky if you can die a normal death after running into a curse."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Even if they find your body all torn apart, that still might be considered all right."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If you were to start investigating the remains of Sakura, you'd probably witness some gruesome scenes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I can't guarantee that you won't be a victim one day."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Any- way..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Pick your hell."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You're a strong kid, so help people."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If Sukuna is completely eliminated ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...Will there be fewer people killed by Curses?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Do you still have that finger?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Now that I look at it again, it's pretty disgusting."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Chomp"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Gulp"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "thats number two. One-tenth of the way there, huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What's gonna happen?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "FShH"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Mr"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "KRIK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Heh ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Heh heh ..."
    }
